.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CSMP's implementation of a compressed-row storage container for sparse matrices\&. 


.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
S\&.K\&. Matthai 

.PP
SS\&. Geiger 

.PP
Coumou, D\&. 

.PP
Stephen G\&. Roberts 
.RE
