\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
Qi Shao 
.RE
.PP
\fBDate\fP
.RS 4
2022(modified)
.RE
.PP
This class implements the classic condensed row storage format for sparse matrices that is common to many linear algebra packages\&. This matrix is always square\&.

.PP
Currently used to convert \fBcsmp::SparseMatrix\fP objects before they are passed to the SAMG solver\&. Now also directly used in \fBPDE_Integrator\fP (2022, Qi Shao) 
